# Marketcraft currently ships with mock data and needs no environment
# variables to run `npm run dev`, `npm run build`, or `npm test`.
#
# This file exists as the documented place to add configuration once the
# mock product/category repository (src/lib/repositories/) is swapped for a
# real API — see docs/decisions.md for that seam. Vite only exposes
# variables prefixed with VITE_ to client code, for example:
#
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.example.com
